<title>NORWAY: Dyno Q1 pre-tax profits up.</title>
<headline>Dyno Q1 pre-tax profits up.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>			   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenue	   2,554	 vs	  2,277</p>
<p> Operating result		102	 vs	    117</p>
<p> Net financial items	  -10	  vs	    -27</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		  93	  vs	     86</p>
<p> Result after tax		49	  vs	     52</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Norwegian chemicals, explosives and plastics group is Dyno Industrier ASA. Eight analysts polled by Reuters had expected Dyno to post pre-tax profits of 101 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 00 18</p>
</text>
